# Crates level (recorded from a scripted controller): push the big crate to
# the 4-tile wall, back off, hop onto the crate, jump up to the ledge, hop
# the spikes and reach the exit. The wall can't be jumped from the floor.
level crates
180 R
expect crate.x == 288 +- 0.5
expect crate.y == 208
1 -
25 L
23 R
1 RJ
45 R
1 RJ
83 R
1 RJ
49 R
expect exit == 1
expect deaths == 0
